1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,417
The ninth arc closed with a public forum in the center of town, where the manner of the meeting was as important as its content.

2
00:00:07,417 --> 00:00:14,760
“A logical argument will appear convincing and an authentic one will appear true,” the mayor said.

3
00:00:14,760 --> 00:00:22,409
“We must avoid the first and produce the second.” A sorry silence followed.

4
00:00:22,409 --> 00:00:30,878
The interested parties were the postman, a widower, and a resourceful bachelor who had come to advertise a loan scheme.

5
00:00:30,878 --> 00:00:37,112
“There is a misunderstanding about what visibility means,” the postman said.

6
00:00:37,112 --> 00:00:42,921
“A correct figure that nobody can see is a joke with a tear in it.”

7
00:00:42,921 --> 00:00:51,205
The summit of the evening was the explanatory brief, which was adequate, applicable, and mercifully short.

8
00:00:51,205 --> 00:00:57,404
“We can detect the foreseeable error only if we publish it,” the treasurer said.

9
00:00:57,404 --> 00:01:03,328
“An exemplary account is one that a disputable line can survive.”

10
00:01:03,328 --> 00:01:08,367
The argumentative member provoked the only real dispute of the night.

11
00:01:08,367 --> 00:01:14,556
“A purposeful policy is not the same as a manhood contest,” she said.

12
00:01:14,556 --> 00:01:19,895
“An erroneous forecast is harmless if the correction arrives in time.

13
00:01:19,895 --> 00:01:23,695
An apologetic one is not.”

14
00:01:23,695 --> 00:01:33,993
The visibility of the accounts, the mercy of a payment plan, and the truthful narration of the failure were the three things the meeting produced.

15
00:01:33,993 --> 00:01:39,272
“A satisfactory result would be a boring one,” Maya wrote.

16
00:01:39,272 --> 00:01:42,967
“That is what we should aim for.”

17
00:01:42,967 --> 00:01:47,816
The existence of the scheme no longer depended on a single vote.

18
00:01:47,816 --> 00:01:58,744
A certain section of the town, a common type of household, and the strong support of the center had built something that could survive a change of council.

19
00:01:58,744 --> 00:02:05,068
The next arc would begin with a loan, a summit, and a question about who owns the record.

20
00:02:05,068 --> 00:02:13,617
The town, the section, the type, and the term: four words that a strong effect could build into a common center.

21
00:02:13,617 --> 00:02:18,066
We must add more to the account and cut less from the record.

22
00:02:18,066 --> 00:02:26,234
The political meeting would begin again in the winter, and the certain things would then be the full list and the strong evidence.

23
00:02:26,234 --> 00:02:30,014
The build of the scheme mattered more than its size.

24
00:02:30,014 --> 00:02:38,112
Aside from the publicity, the fascinating and arguable part was that an observant reader could check every line.

25
00:02:38,112 --> 00:02:46,700
They had published who pays; the harder page, who decides, was still blank.
